{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed editing scope",
      "text": "PROJECT BRIEF\nSeller: Nali Visuals, Kenya\nBuyer: Tavi\nProject: One YouTube video about balcony gardening\nAgreed fee: INR 18,000\n\nAgreed deliverables:\n- Deliver one finished video in 1080p MP4 format.\n- Add English subtitles throughout the finished video.\n- Use only music licensed for commercial YouTube use.\n- Provide a separate YouTube thumbnail image.\n\nTavi approved this brief before editing began. Nali Visuals will deliver the files electronically. The fee covers the listed deliverables and one round of corrections to those deliverables. Any additional edits or formats require a separate agreement."
    },
    {
      "title": "Delivery handover",
      "text": "HANDOVER NOTE\nFrom: Nali Visuals\nTo: Tavi\nProject: Balcony gardening video\n\nDelivered files:\n- balcony-final.mp4 — finished video, 1920 × 1080, MP4.\n- balcony-thumbnail.png — separate YouTube thumbnail image.\n\nThe MP4 contains the completed edit and music. English subtitles are embedded for the introduction and first two sections; subtitles for the final section are not included. The thumbnail is supplied as a separate image rather than embedded in the video.\n\nThe music licensing record was placed in a separate folder, but that folder is not included with this handover note. Please review the files and send any corrections covered by the agreed round."
    },
    {
      "title": "Chat after delivery",
      "text": "Tavi, 10:12: I received the video and the separate thumbnail. The picture looks good on my channel preview.\n\nNali, 10:18: Thanks for checking. The video is the 1080p MP4 listed in the handover.\n\nTavi, 10:24: The English subtitles stop before the final section. Can you finish them in the correction round?\n\nNali, 10:31: Yes, I can add the remaining subtitles. I will send a revised file when it is ready.\n\nTavi, 10:36: Please also send the music licensing record from the separate folder. I cannot assess the license from the video alone.\n\nNali, 10:40: I will include it with the revision."
    }
  ],
